/* 12段零工熟客/东家后续 + 6段收集信物NPC鉴看反应 = 18段 */
:: MP Job Followup Cafe [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
打烊前，常坐靠窗三号桌的老乐手特意留步，点名请你替他打包两份柠檬司康与热红茶，说是认准了你烤司康的火候。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海风咖啡馆 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_cafe is 1>>
这处暗格今天已经仔细查验过，眼下并无新的动静。
<<else>>
<div id="job-fup-cafe">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用锡纸与油布双层包好保温 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-cafe">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_cafe to 1>>
	老乐手欣慰地接过温热餐包，在吧台木碟下压了一张整钞与一张旧音乐会书签。<span class="green">熟客对你的周到赞不绝口。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_cafe")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	系麻绳时纸袋边角裂了一道小口，你连忙换了一只新纸袋重新装好。<span class="red">匆忙打包时被热茶壶柄烫了一下手背。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Cafe]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "附赠一小盅柠檬蜜酱 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-cafe">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_cafe to 1>>
		你特意取来一小盅清香的柠檬蜜酱摆在餐盒旁，酸甜果香让热餐包更显诱人。<span class="green">老乐手尝了一口蜜酱，眉眼舒展地连声夸你贴心。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_cafe")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收拾台面返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	取蜜酱时木勺柄滑了一下，柠檬汁滴在了托盘布上。<span class="red">你连忙换过一块干净餐巾，手背被热水壶烘得发烫。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Cafe]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Fish [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
梅尔街酒馆的采买厨师一早赶到栈桥，越过别的摊位直奔你面前，说只有你剔过刺的银鳕鱼柳最合酒馆贵客的口味。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回栈桥鱼档 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_fish is 1>>
今日的事宜已料理妥当，无需在此处重复费神。
<<else>>
<div id="job-fup-fish">
<<tendingicon>><<link "快刀片出无刺鱼柳 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-fish">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_fish to 1>>
	采买厨师拎起竹篓满意离去，老渔夫笑着把酒馆多付的加急刀工钱全塞给了你。<span class="green">你的熟练刀工赢得了酒馆长期订货。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_fish")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	刀尖在鱼骨上滑了一下，虽然没伤到手，却切碎了一片鱼腹肉。<span class="red">冰水浸得手指发僵，刀路略显滞涩。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Fish]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "铺碎冰与海带分层码齐 (0:08)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-fish">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_fish to 1>>
		你按酒馆冷鲜规矩在竹篓底铺匀碎冰与湿海带，将鱼柳一层层隔开码齐。<span class="green">鱼肉锁住了鲜甜汁水，采买厨师连声称赞。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_fish")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收拾台面返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
碎冰铺得太厚顶起了竹篓盖，你重排海带时冻得指节通红。<span class="red">寒气渗入指缝，你只得先停手暖一暖。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Fish]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Spa [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
上次夸过你手法的退休歌剧女高音再次光临浴场，指名要你替她调配一桶薰衣草舒缓浴盐并按揉肩颈。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回温泉浴场 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_spa is 1>>
周围一切平静如常，今天不必再往里翻检了。
<<else>>
<div id="job-fup-spa">
<<tendingicon>><<link "按温水比例兑入薰衣草精油 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-spa">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_spa to 1>>
	女高音舒心地长舒一口气，临走前将一只装着小费的丝绒袋放进你托盘里。<span class="green">常客对你调配的香浴极为满意。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_spa")>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	水汽太浓熏得你额头冒汗，取浴巾时脚下差点打滑。<span class="red">闷热水雾让你感到一阵头晕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Spa]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺穴位推开酸痛结节 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-spa">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_spa to 1>>
		你顺着肩颈经络用掌根稳稳推开紧绷的肌肉结节，力道由浅入深恰到好处。<span class="green">女高音舒服得微眯起眼，连声称赞你的推拿手艺。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_spa")>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收拾台面返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浴房水汽湿滑，你按压肩井穴时指尖滑了半寸，没能一次揉开酸痛处。<span class="red">你忙放轻力道热敷片刻，额角沁出一层细汗。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Spa]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Farm [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
镇上面包房的老板赶着马车来到农场，一眼认出正在清点麦袋的你，托你帮他挑两袋今年日照最足的头茬红麦。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场打谷场 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_farm is 1>>
你今天已经把这里的首尾收拾干净，先回前头歇息吧。
<<else>>
<div id="job-fup-farm">
<<tendingicon>><<link "凭干湿度挑出头茬麦 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-farm">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_farm to 1>>
	面包房老板拍着饱满麦袋连声称好，塞给你一袋刚烤好的黄油餐包与挑选费。<span class="green">你挑出的头茬红麦让老主顾眉开眼笑。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_farm")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	麻袋绳扣磨红了你的肩膀，麦芒也扎得手腕发痒。<span class="red">沉重麦袋压得肩膀酸痛。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Farm]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "扛起两袋红麦装上马车 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-farm">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_farm to 1>>
		你深吸一口气，双手托住麻袋底角一鼓作气将两袋红麦稳稳扛上了马车车斗。<span class="green">面包房老板竖起大拇指，当场多算了你一份搬运赏钱。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_farm")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收拾台面返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	红麦麻袋沉甸甸地压在肩头，车板边缘有些打滑，你迈步时差点闪了腰。<span class="red">你连忙扶住车辕卸下麦袋，肩膀被粗麻磨得发红。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫稳脚下重心再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Farm]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Clock [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
一位老列车长推门走进钟表铺，点名找你保养他那只铁路精准报时怀表：「上次你校过之后，整整一季没慢过半秒。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回钟表修缮台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_clock is 1>>
此处今日已经走过一遭，趁天色尚早去别处转转吧。
<<else>>
<div id="job-fup-clock">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用鹿皮清细微煤灰 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-clock">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_clock to 1>>
	怀表再次发出清脆有力的滴答声，老列车长高兴地在柜台上留下一笔丰厚保养费。<span class="green">老列车长对你的校表手艺深信不疑。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_clock")>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你在放大镜下盯得太久，眼睛酸涩流泪，镊子尖也碰歪了表蒙垫圈。<span class="red">长时间细看令双目酸痛不已。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Clock]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "耐着性子给发条点入钟表油 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-clock">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_clock to 1>>
		你屏住呼吸用点油针蘸取微滴钟表油，精准点入发条盒轴芯与擒纵叉宝石眼内。<span class="green">发条收放顿时顺滑无声，老列车长听着走时声喜笑颜开。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_clock")>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收拾台面返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	点油针尖端抖了半毫，一滴表油差点渗到游丝外圈，惊得你急忙用吸油纸吸干。<span class="red">长时间屏息凝神让你眼角发酸，只得先停手歇息。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Clock]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Laundry [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
学校图书馆的老管理员抱着一摞开线的十九世纪地方志找上门，指名请你用上次那种双股麻线锁边法替他重订书脊。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回洗衣装订坊 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_laundry is 1>>
桌案与器物都已归置妥帖，今天不用再忙活这一摊了。
<<else>>
<div id="job-fup-laundry">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用骨锥穿入双股麻线 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-laundry">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_laundry to 1>>
	古籍书脊被修整得挺括牢固，老管理员欣喜地付了双倍装订手工费。<span class="green">你修复的古籍装订看不出半点歪斜。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_laundry")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
