	骨锥尖端不小心刺破了指尖，你连忙偏手才没染上书页。<span class="red">麻线勒痛手指，指尖被骨锥刺了一下。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Laundry]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
