<<link "仔细刷浆糊压平羊皮封壳 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-laundry">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_laundry to 1>>
		你用扁平猪鬃刷蘸上温热小麦浆糊，顺着羊皮封壳纹理一点点刷匀并压上镇纸。<span class="green">起翘的古籍封壳服服帖帖地粘牢，看不出半点气泡。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_laundry")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收拾台面返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	温浆糊涂得略厚了一层，按压羊皮纸角时溢出了少许白边。<span class="red">你连忙拿微湿棉布擦净边角，手指沾满了黏稠浆糊。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Laundry]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Bakery [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "dawn" or Time.dayState is "morning">>清晨天刚亮，<<else>>后门刚卸下门板，<</if>>孤儿院隔壁街区的老太太挎着竹篮等在面包房后门，笑吟吟地问今天有没有你亲手揉的葡萄干软欧包。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街面包房 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_bakery is 1>>
暗记与门锁今日已核对无误，留待改日再来留心吧。
<<else>>
<div id="job-fup-bakery">
