<<else>>
<div id="ks-show-whistle">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "请维斯试吹引航哨音暗码 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-whistle">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_whistle to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	维斯将铜哨穿上一根涂蜡海魂绳挂回你颈间。<span class="green">维斯为你解开了铜哨的引航暗码。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_whistle_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	海风吹晃防风灯，维斯先帮你将铜哨收好，约好等下次退潮再去核对暗礁。<span class="teal">维斯叮嘱你收紧铜哨挂绳。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "与他核对铜哨壁的暗礁航线 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-whistle">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_whistle to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你与维斯并肩凑在防风灯下，将铜哨内壁镌刻的潮汐折线与私港古海图逐一比对。<span class="green">隐藏在暗礁群后的归航盲道被你们彻底核对清楚。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_whistle_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收妥信物返回 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	铜哨内壁的微雕细如发丝，船舱马灯晃动间你看得眼眶发酸也没能对齐刻度。<span class="red">维斯体贴地替你合上海图，让你先喝口热茶歇歇眼睛。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Show Core [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
你将机括城深处取出的发条擒纵游丝芯放在胡桃木柜台上。塞拉戴上单眼放大镜屏息端详：「这是百年前初代钟表匠手工淬火的蓝钢母芯，我找了整整三年！」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回塞拉身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_core is 1>>
今日这一带的动静已经摸透，改天换个时辰再来吧。
<<else>>
<div id="ks-show-core">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "请塞拉测算母芯的摆频齿数 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-core">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_core to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	塞拉小心地替游丝芯配好防磁水晶外盒交还给你。<span class="green">塞拉替你将机括母芯保养得完好如初。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_core_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	柜台煤油灯芯微暗，塞拉取出绒布替你把游丝芯包妥。<span class="teal">塞拉约你改天带高倍镜再细看。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Core]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用鹿皮与表油替母芯封存 (0:08)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-core">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_core to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你配合塞拉用软鹿皮蘸取钟表防锈油，将蓝钢母芯的枢轴逐一润泽封存。<span class="green">蓝钢游丝在灯光下泛起温润的幽蓝光泽。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_core_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收妥信物返回 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
镊子尖端在防磁盒边沿轻轻磕了一下，惊得你屏住呼吸。<span class="red">塞拉连忙接手稳住表芯，让你先歇口气。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Core]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Show Ring [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
你在防风灯下取出沉没修道院石龛里的银鸽指环。阿什托起你的手掌仔细辨认戒圈内侧的古符文：「这是早年守墓人与守林人互通消息的信物，戴着它，林间暗哨都会护你周全。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回阿什身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_ring is 1>>
你确认四周再无遗漏，今天的事便到此为止。
<<else>>
<div id="ks-show-ring">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "请阿什用松脂擦亮银戒内纹 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-ring">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_ring to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	阿什用鹿皮将银鸽指环擦得温润生辉。<span class="green">银鸽指环在灯下焕发出温润光泽。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_ring_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	林间夜雾渐浓，阿什用松脂布替你将银鸽戒包好。<span class="teal">阿什提醒你进深林时戴稳指环。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Ring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "向他请教戒面银鸽纹来历 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-ring">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_ring to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你指着戒面展翅欲飞的银鸽暗纹向阿什请教，阿什取出古教团纹章册与你逐页参详。<span class="green">你们一同参透了银鸽尾羽指向的守林人联络暗记。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_ring_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收妥信物返回 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	戒圈内侧的古拉丁缩写磨损严重，你在防风灯下辨认良久仍觉得字形模棱两可。<span class="red">眼眶看得有些发酸，阿什劝你改天借放大镜再看。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Ring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Show Amber [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to ($mpNpcs.noel or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
你将秘密温室地窖寻获的琥珀香膏瓶捧给诺艾尔看。诺艾尔惊喜得捂住嘴唇：「里面封存的竟然是未受杂交的初代银脉兰花粉，这下我们的安神秘方再也不愁断根了！」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回诺艾尔身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
