	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	诺艾尔只取了毫厘花粉便将琥珀香膏瓶完好封存还你。<span class="green">初代花粉让诺艾尔的研究大步推进。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_amber_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	准备室窗外天色已暗，诺艾尔用吸水纸替你裹好琥珀匣。<span class="teal">诺艾尔约你明日配齐试剂再取样。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Amber]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "对照本草图鉴记录花粉活性 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-amber">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_amber to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你翻开诺艾尔案头的《孤本夜光本草图鉴》，将琥珀香膏瓶里银脉兰花粉的荧光色泽逐条记录。<span class="green">详实的活性记录补全了图鉴空白，诺艾尔欣喜地握住了你的手。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_amber_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收妥信物返回 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	花房水雾打湿了记录纸边缘，蘸水笔尖在纸面上晕开了一团蓝墨。<span class="red">你连忙拿吸墨纸按干字迹，准备换张干爽卡片重写。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Amber]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Show Medal [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to ($mpNpcs.lin or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.lin>>
你把黑铁货运站底舱找到的站长纪念铜章递给林恩。林恩摩挲着铜章背面的齿轮锤纹，眼神微震：「这是当年带头抵制黑货的老师傅留下的徽记，货运站的老工人全都认它。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回林恩身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
