	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	巷口吹来冷风，林恩替你把铜章擦净塞回衣兜。<span class="teal">林恩说下次带你去认认老工友。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Medal]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用细砂纸打磨铜章绿锈 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-medal">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_medal to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你裁下一小块极细的金相砂纸，顺着站长纪念铜章的齿轮浮雕纹理轻轻打磨掉陈年绿锈。<span class="green">铜章背面的工号与星火铭文重现灿然金光，林恩看得赞叹不已。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_medal_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[收妥信物返回 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	凹槽深处的铜绿结得颇硬，砂纸边缘折了一下刮在你的指甲盖上。<span class="red">林恩连忙握住你的手吹了吹，接过砂纸替你收尾。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Medal]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
