<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Show Antler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
你取出深林古石环寻获的白鹿角坠饰请莫奈鉴看。莫奈指尖轻抚过鹿角上流畅的螺旋浮雕，眼底满是惊叹：「多美的古凯尔特刀工，这纹样正好能做我们下一季高定胸针的母模！」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好信物返回莫奈身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_antler is 1>>
现场痕迹已被你抚平，今天无需再多生枝节。
<<else>>
<div id="ks-show-antler">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "用软布拓下螺旋纹样 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-antler">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_antler to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	莫奈替白鹿角坠饰系上华美的暗金丝穗还给你。<span class="green">白鹿角坠饰化作了精美的随身佩饰。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_antler_reward")>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	画室烛火摇晃，莫奈先用丝帕替你把白鹿角坠饰包好。<span class="teal">莫奈约你改日白昼再来拓印纹样。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Antler]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
